      "message": "Ahh yes, you are right, will need to fix that.\n\nIts a bit tricky though. pi_desc is only a 64 bytes. We have two classes of PI descriptors:\n1. Global per-cpu pi_desc defined at build time, I think it should not be hard to verify if the Descriptor is one of these per-cpu defined ones in modify_irte as they are build time defined. \n2. For guest VM vcpus, the desc is in `vcpu_vmx-\u003evcpu_pt-\u003epi_desc`. We could probably go through all vcpus and verify if this address is one of those. Will go through the path again and see how it could be done effectively.",
